  const settingsSections=[['gameplay','玩法','战','施法、教程与战斗反馈'],['accessibility','无障碍','辅','色觉、闪烁与字号'],['graphics','图像','画','画质、帧率与分辨率'],['audio','音频','音','音乐、音效与UI反馈'],['controls','控制','控','触控与PC按键'],['network','网络与地区','网','地区、延迟与语言'],['privacy','隐私','隐','公开资料范围'],['account','账号与数据','账','设备、导出与删除']];
  function settingRow(label,copy,control){return `<label class="setting-row"><span><b>${label}</b><small>${copy}</small></span>${control}</label>`;}
  function renderSettings(){ $('#settings-nav').innerHTML=settingsSections.map(x=>`<button class="${state.ui.settingsTab===x[0]?'active':''}" data-action="settings-tab" data-tab="${x[0]}" aria-current="${state.ui.settingsTab===x[0]?'page':'false'}"><i>${x[2]}</i><span><b>${x[1]}</b><small>${x[3]}</small></span></button>`).join('');const s=state.settings,currentSection=settingsSections.find(x=>x[0]===state.ui.settingsTab)||settingsSections[0];let html='';if(state.ui.settingsTab==='gameplay')html=settingRow('智能施法','轻点智能施法，按住拖动精确瞄准',check('smartCast',s.smartCast))+settingRow('教程提示','前六局及首次遇到对象时显示',check('tutorial',s.tutorial))+settingRow('伤害数字','命中目标时显示数值',check('damageNumbers',s.damageNumbers));if(state.ui.settingsTab==='accessibility')html=settingRow('色觉模式','关闭/绿色弱/红色弱/蓝黄色弱',select('colorMode',['关闭','绿色弱','红色弱','蓝黄色弱'],s.colorMode))+settingRow('高对比指示','危险、五行和敌我增加形状通道',check('highContrast',s.highContrast))+settingRow('低闪模式','形状脉冲+边框+文字，判定时间不变',check('lowFlash',s.lowFlash))+settingRow('镜头震动','关闭不影响命中信息',check('cameraShake',s.cameraShake))+settingRow('字幕','默认开启',check('subtitles',s.subtitles))+settingRow('界面缩放','80/90/100/110/120/130',select('interfaceScale',['80','90','100','110','120','130'],String(s.interfaceScale)))+settingRow('文本缩放','90/100/110/120/130',select('textScale',['90','100','110','120','130'],String(s.textScale)));if(state.ui.settingsTab==='graphics')html=settingRow('画质','自动/低/中/高',select('quality',['自动','低','中','高'],s.quality))+settingRow('帧率','30/45/60 FPS · 默认30',select('fps',['30','45','60'],s.fps))+settingRow('分辨率比例','0.7/0.85/1.0 · 默认0.85',select('resolution',['0.7','0.85','1.0'],s.resolution));if(state.ui.settingsTab==='audio'){const manifest=audioRuntime.manifest,status=manifest?`${Object.keys(manifest.assets||{}).length}条已接入 · ${manifest.excluded?.length||0}条隔离`:'首次交互后加载音频清单';html=['master','music','sfx','ui'].map((k,i)=>settingRow(['主音量','音乐','音效','UI音量'][i],'设备本地设置',range(k,s[k]))).join('')+`<section class="audio-asset-status" data-audio-review-state="${esc(manifest?.licenseState||'LOADING')}"><b>音频包 · 中文易读版 20260813</b><span>${esc(status)}</span><small>当前接入9条UI反馈、大厅主题和百眼迷城环境；对局/决赛BGM及不合格循环已隔离。</small><em>原包为ElevenLabs免费套餐预览产物，正式商业发行前必须补齐授权。</em></section>`;}if(state.ui.settingsTab==='controls')html=settingRow('手机控件缩放','80–120；不提供自由拖拽布局',range('touchScale',s.touchScale,80,120))+settingRow('手机控件透明度','80–120；命中盒保持不变',range('touchOpacity',s.touchOpacity,80,120))+settingRow('PC瞄准灵敏度','50–200；键位重绑检查冲突',range('sensitivity',s.sensitivity,50,200))+`<button class="btn secondary" data-action="keybind">PC玩法键重绑</button>`;if(state.ui.settingsTab==='network')html=settingRow('匹配地区','首发地区由服务端锁定为CN','<select disabled><option>CN</option></select>')+settingRow('网络数据显示','开启后显示RTT/丢包',check('networkData',s.networkData))+settingRow('界面语言','首发仅开放简体中文','<select disabled><option>简体中文</option></select>');if(state.ui.settingsTab==='privacy')html=settingRow('战绩公开','自己始终可见完整资料',check('publicHistory',s.publicHistory))+settingRow('常用英雄公开','与战绩公开独立',check('publicHeroes',s.publicHeroes));if(state.ui.settingsTab==='account')html=`<div class="settings-action-grid"><button class="btn secondary" data-action="go-account">账号安全与设备<small>绑定身份、管理登录设备</small></button><button class="btn secondary" data-action="export-data">导出账号数据<small>创建可下载的数据包</small></button></div><div class="danger-zone"><b>危险操作</b><small>删除申请有7天冷静期</small><button class="btn danger" data-action="delete-account">删除账号</button></div>`;$('#settings-content').innerHTML=`<header class="settings-section-head"><i>${currentSection[2]}</i><span><h3>${currentSection[1]}</h3><p>${currentSection[3]} · 更改后自动保存</p></span></header><div class="settings-panel-body">${html}</div>`;}
  function check(key,val){return `<input type="checkbox" data-setting="${key}" ${val?'checked':''}>`;}function select(key,opts,val){return `<select data-setting="${key}">${opts.map(x=>`<option ${x===val?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`;}function range(key,val,min=0,max=100){return `<input type="range" min="${min}" max="${max}" value="${val}" data-setting="${key}">`;}
  function applySetting(key,value){if(key==='lowFlash')document.body.classList.toggle('low-flash',value);if(key==='highContrast')document.body.classList.toggle('high-contrast',value);if(key==='colorMode')document.body.dataset.colorMode=value;if(key==='touchScale')document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--touch-scale',value/100);if(key==='touchOpacity')document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--touch-opacity',value/100);if(key==='interfaceScale')document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--interface-scale',Number(value)/100);if(key==='textScale')document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--text-scale',Number(value)/100);if(key==='cameraShake')document.body.classList.toggle('no-shake',!value);if(['master','music','sfx','ui'].includes(key))syncBackgroundAudio();}
  async function saveSetting(input){const key=input.dataset.setting,old=state.settings[key],value=input.type==='checkbox'?input.checked:input.type==='range'?Number(input.value):input.value;$('#save-state').textContent='保存中…';try{await authority('SAVE_SETTING',null,()=>state.settings[key]=value);$('#save-state').textContent='已保存';applySetting(key,value);trackTimer(setTimeout(()=>$('#save-state').textContent='逐项自动保存',900));}catch(e){state.settings[key]=old;applySetting(key,old);renderSettings();toast('保存失败，已恢复权威值');}}
  function resetSettingsCategory(tab){openModal('恢复默认 · Y-16',`恢复“${settingsSections.find(x=>x[0]===tab)?.[1]||tab}”默认值？`,`<div class="notice danger">只重置当前分类；其他设置不会改变。保存失败时恢复各项权威值。</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn danger" data-action="confirm-reset-settings" data-tab="${tab}">确认恢复</button><button class="btn ghost" data-action="close-modal">取消</button></div>`,{type:'settings-reset'});}
  function confirmResetSettings(tab){const defaults={gameplay:{smartCast:true,tutorial:true,damageNumbers:true},accessibility:{colorMode:'关闭',highContrast:false,lowFlash:false,cameraShake:true,subtitles:true,interfaceScale:100,textScale:100},graphics:{quality:'自动',fps:'30',resolution:'0.85'},audio:{master:80,music:60,sfx:80,ui:70},controls:{touchScale:100,touchOpacity:100,sensitivity:100},network:{region:'CN',networkData:false},privacy:{publicHistory:true,publicHeroes:true}},values=defaults[tab]||{};authority('RESET_SETTINGS_CATEGORY',null,()=>Object.assign(state.settings,values)).then(()=>{Object.entries(values).forEach(([k,v])=>applySetting(k,v));closeModal();renderSettings();toast('当前分类已恢复真源默认');});}
  function openKeybind(){const labels={move:'移动',attack:'普攻',active:'主动技能',interact:'交互',map:'全地图',build:'构筑面板',recenter:'镜头回中'};openModal('PC键位 · Y-07/Y-18','玩法键重绑',`<div class="notice">点击动作后按下新按键。冲突时必须选择交换、覆盖或取消；系统Esc不可重绑。模态期间按键不会传入战斗。</div><div class="keybind-list">${Object.entries(state.settings.keymap).map(([key,value])=>`<button data-action="capture-key" data-key="${key}"><span><b>${labels[key]}</b><small>${key==='move'?'移动使用一组方向键':'单一动作'}</small></span><kbd>${value}</kbd></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn secondary" data-action="reset-keybinds">恢复本分类默认</button><button class="btn ghost" data-action="close-modal">完成</button></div>`,{type:'keybind'});}
  function captureKey(key){state.ui.keyCapture=key;openModal('等待输入 · Y-18','请按下新按键',`<div class="key-capture"><i>⌨</i><h3>正在监听键盘输入</h3><p>Esc为系统返回键，不可绑定。按Esc取消本次捕获。</p></div>`,{type:'key-capture',key});}
  function commitCapturedKey(code){const key=state.ui.keyCapture;if(!key)return;state.ui.keyCapture=null;if(code==='Escape'){openKeybind();return toast('已取消键位捕获');}const conflict=Object.entries(state.settings.keymap).find(([k,v])=>k!==key&&v===code);if(conflict)return openModal('键位冲突 · Y-18',`${code} 已被占用`,`<div class="notice danger">当前用于“${conflict[0]}”。请选择交换、覆盖或取消；保存前不会改变现有绑定。</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn primary" data-action="resolve-key-conflict" data-key="${key}" data-other="${conflict[0]}" data-code="${code}" data-mode="swap">交换</button><button class="btn danger" data-action="resolve-key-conflict" data-key="${key}" data-other="${conflict[0]}" data-code="${code}" data-mode="overwrite">覆盖</button><button class="btn ghost" data-action="keybind">取消</button></div>`,{type:'key-conflict'});authority('SAVE_KEYBIND',null,()=>state.settings.keymap[key]=code).then(()=>{openKeybind();toast('键位已保存');});}
